UserController ..> CreateUserRequest

QuestionCardController --> QuestionCardDAO
QuestionCardController --> CardDeckDAO
QuestionCardController --> OpenAiQuestionCardService
QuestionCardController ..> GenerateQuestionCardsRequest
QuestionCardController ..> QuestionCardDTO

CoinController ..> Coin
DiceController ..> Dice

' Service-afhaengigheder

GameCreationService --> GameBoardDAO
GameCreationService --> QuestionCardDAO
GameCreationService --> OpenAiQuestionCardService
GameCreationService --> AgeGroupService
GameCreationService ..> CreateGameRequest
GameCreationService ..> CreatePlayerRequest
GameCreationService ..> Game

UserGameService --> GameCreationService
UserGameService ..> GameDAO
UserGameService ..> UserDAO

GameService ..> Game
GameService --> MonkeyChallengeService
GameService --> AgeGroupService
GameService --> Dice
GameService --> QuestionCardDAO
GameService ..> TurnResult

PlayerProgressService ..> PlayerDAO
PlayerProgressService ..> Player

QuestencardService --> QuestionCardDAO
QuestencardService --> OpenAiQuestionCardService
QuestencardService --> AgeGroupService
QuestencardService ..> QuestionCard

OpenAiQuestionCardService --> QuestionCardDAO
OpenAiQuestionCardService ..> QuestionCard
OpenAiQuestionCardService ..> GeneratedQuestion
OpenAiQuestionCardService ..> CardDeck

UserService --> UserDAO
UserService ..> PasswordUtils
UserService ..> UserDTO

MonkeyChallengeService ..> Dice
MonkeyChallengeService ..> Player
MonkeyChallengeService ..> Game
MonkeyChallengeService --> ChallengeState
MonkeyChallengeService ..> ChallengeStatus
MonkeyChallengeService ..> DrawResult

' DAO-afhaengigheder

UserDAO ..> User
GameDAO ..> Game
GameBoardDAO ..> GameBoard
GameNameDAO ..> GameName
PlayerDAO ..> Player
QuestionCardDAO ..> QuestionCard
CardDeckDAO ..> CardDeck

' DTO-afhaengigheder

